% ================================================================ the queries
query classification is:
    which system is classified as which class on the basis of which provision.

query roles is:
    which operator has the role which role for which system.

query requalification is:
    which operator is considered the provider of which system under which provision.

query prohibitions is:
    the prohibition of which provision already applies to which operator for which system.

query prohibitions_later is:
    the prohibition of which provision applies to which operator for which system only from which date that is in which number days.

query in_force is:
    which obligation already applies to which operator for which system.

query later is:
    which obligation applies to which operator for which system only from which date that is in which number days.

query legacy is:
    which system is subject to Chapter III only after a significant change in its design from which date.

query fria is:
    the fundamental rights impact assessment for which system is which verdict.

query dpia is:
    which operator may reuse its data protection impact assessment in the fundamental rights impact assessment for which system.

query escalation is:
    which system goes to a human for a full analysis because which reason.

query gaps is:
    the triage of which system has the gap which gap.

query stage is:
    the query fails at which section.

query flip_hr is:
    which minimal change to the scenario makes it the case that
        it is not the case that TalentSift is high risk.

% ================================================================ the view
the view triage card is:
    the title is "EU AI Act triage card".
    the case is a scenario, with the documents it is stated in.
    the facts about "The system and the date of the triage" are
        a system is triaged on a date,
        a system was first placed on the market or put into service on a date.
    the facts about "Is it an AI system (Article 3(1))" are
        a system is a machine based system,
        a system is designed to operate with varying levels of autonomy,
        a system infers from the input it receives how to generate outputs,
        a system does not infer how to generate its outputs,
        the outputs of a system can influence physical or virtual environments.
    the facts about "The operators (Articles 3 and 25)" are
        an operator places a system on the market under its own name,
        an operator puts a system into service under its own name,
        an operator uses a system under its own authority,
        an operator puts its name or trademark on a system,
        an operator makes a substantial modification to a system,
        an operator modifies the intended purpose of a system,
        an operator is a body governed by public law,
        an operator is a private entity providing public services,
        an operator is a private entity that does not provide public services,
        an operator has a data protection impact assessment for a system.
    the facts about "Use and risk (Articles 5 and 6, Annexes I and III)" are
        a system is intended to be used for a use,
        a system performs profiling of natural persons,
        a system does not perform profiling of natural persons,
        a system is intended to perform a narrow procedural task,
        a system is intended to perform a preparatory task to an assessment relevant for the use cases of Annex III,
        a system is itself a product covered by an act,
        a system is a component of a product covered by an act,
        a system must undergo a third party conformity assessment under an act,
        a system is used solely for non safety related purposes such as user assistance or optimisation,
        a system infers emotions of natural persons in the workplace or in education institutions,
        generating a material is the intended purpose of a system.
    the facts about "General-purpose AI and transparency (Chapter V, Article 50)" are
        a system is based on the general purpose AI model a model,
        an operator places the general purpose AI model a model on the market,
        the cumulative training computation of a model is a number floating point operations,
        a system is intended to interact directly with natural persons,
        a system generates synthetic a kind content.
    every fact shows who states it.
    the result is the answer to query classification, headed by the class.
    the result shows its citations.
    the answers to "which operator has the role which role for which system" are listed as "Operator roles".
    the answers to "which operator is considered the provider of which system under which provision" are listed as "Requalification as provider (Article 25)".
    the answers to "which obligation already applies to which operator for which system" are listed as "Obligations that apply on the date of the triage".
    the answers to "which obligation applies to which operator for which system only from which date that is in which number days" are listed as "Obligations that apply later".
    the answers to "the prohibition of which provision already applies to which operator for which system" are listed as "Prohibitions that apply".
    the answers to "the prohibition of which provision applies to which operator for which system only from which date that is in which number days" are listed as "Prohibitions that apply later".
    the answers to "which system is subject to Chapter III only after a significant change in its design from which date" are listed as "Systems already on the market (Article 111(2))".
    the answers to "the fundamental rights impact assessment for which system is which verdict" are listed as "Fundamental rights impact assessment (Article 27)".
    the answers to "the triage of which system has the gap which gap" are listed as "Gaps".
    the case is flagged as "Goes to a human for a full analysis" when query escalation has an answer.
    the result can be flipped.
    the documents of the case are shown beside the facts.
